sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Provider as Housing Provider / HMIS
    participant MSO as Billing Agent / MSO 
    participant MCO as Health Plan / MCO

    Provider->>MSO: POST /persons (Register client demographics & Medicaid ID)
    MSO-->>Provider: 201 Created (personId)

    Provider->>MSO: POST /authorizations (Submit housing service auth request with ICD-10 Z-code)
    MSO->>MCO: Evaluate Auth Request (e.g., Z59.01 Homelessness, HCPCS H0043)
    MCO-->>MSO: Return Auth Approval (status = 1)
    MSO-->>Provider: 201 Created (authorizationId, status = Approved)

    Provider->>MSO: POST /authorizations/{authId}/encounters (Log service encounter)
    MSO-->>Provider: 201 Created (encounterId)

    Provider->>MSO: POST /encounters/{encounterId}/claims (Submit billing claim)
    MSO->>MCO: Process Claim (Units, CPT/HCPCS Codes)
    MCO-->>MSO: Adjudicate & Remit Payment
    MSO-->>Provider: 200 OK (Payment Confirmation)
